  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Technical Reading Desk",
    "overview": "Pineapple documentation uses quiet surfaces, purple links, lavender code backgrounds, and bordered containers to make package installation and API examples easy to scan. The existing pineapple and author marks carry the identity; interface decoration remains restrained.\n\nThis is a source-derived description of the incumbent build, not a newly commissioned brand metaphor. PRODUCT.md establishes the technical audience and preservation requirement; no separate visual interview or anti-reference was supplied.",
